{"2448570":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Road Rash™: 30th Anniversary Edition","steam_appid":2448570,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"Road Rash, the franchise which defined the combat racing genre during the 1990s, returns in the first ever digital release of the 1996 PC version.<br><br>Now celebrated in this special 30th Anniversary Edition, the game has been restored to deliver a must-see experience.<br><br><strong>30th Anniversary Edition key improvements:<\/strong><br><br><strong>Relicensed Soundtrack<\/strong> - A fully relicensed soundtrack featuring Soundgarden, Paw, Hammerbox, Monster Magnet, Swervedriver, and Therapy?, with the ability to now play their songs during the racing gameplay.<br><br><strong>Source Master FMVs<\/strong> - In 2022, the Source Master tapes were discovered in the EA physical media vault. These tapes have been digitized and meticulously re-edited frame-by-frame to restore the dozens of FMV scenes, and integrate them back into the game.<br><br><strong>Upscaled FMVs<\/strong> - As an optional enhancement, the FMVs have been further elevated to sharper quality using the latest in video upscaling technology for the best Road Rash cinematics ever seen.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2448570\/extras\/8850502e456609835d451dbf8c7afd07.poster.avif?t=1793986604\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2448570\/extras\/8850502e456609835d451dbf8c7afd07.webm?t=1793986604\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2448570\/extras\/8850502e456609835d451dbf8c7afd07.mp4?t=1793986604\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><strong>Gameplay Optimizations<\/strong> - Enhanced for modern systems, enjoy improved framerates up to 60 FPS, native controller support, windowed mode, cloud saves, and more<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2448570\/extras\/7d1cbd9fecd30af0c52d40dcda57fcff.poster.avif?t=1793986604\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2448570\/extras\/7d1cbd9fecd30af0c52d40dcda57fcff.webm?t=1793986604\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2448570\/extras\/7d1cbd9fecd30af0c52d40dcda57fcff.mp4?t=1793986604\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br>This 30th Anniversary Edition is the ultimate way to enjoy one of the most important franchises in gaming history.<br><br><br><strong>Original Road Rash game description:<\/strong><br><br>Road Rash, the most aggressive motorcycle racing game ever, explodes on your PC with hard-hitting, full-throttle action that'll bring you to your freshly skinned knees. Dodge traffic, outrace cops, and thrash opponents on your way to winning the Cup and becoming the menace to society your mother always worried about.<br><br>- Engage in lawless, no holds barred high speed motor cycle street racing through cities, canyons, and packs of vicious bikers!<br><br>- Photo-realistic 3D graphics with texture-mapping, atmospheric effects and super fast frame rate<br><br>- 25 knee-scraping races: 5 levels of racing, each with 5 courses, means only the toughest rashers have a chance to win the Cup","about_the_game":"Road Rash, the franchise which defined the combat racing genre during the 1990s, returns in the first ever digital release of the 1996 PC version.<br><br>Now celebrated in this special 30th Anniversary Edition, the game has been restored to deliver a must-see experience.<br><br><strong>30th Anniversary Edition key improvements:<\/strong><br><br><strong>Relicensed Soundtrack<\/strong> - A fully relicensed soundtrack featuring Soundgarden, Paw, Hammerbox, Monster Magnet, Swervedriver, and Therapy?, with the ability to now play their songs during the racing gameplay.<br><br><strong>Source Master FMVs<\/strong> - In 2022, the Source Master tapes were discovered in the EA physical media vault. These tapes have been digitized and meticulously re-edited frame-by-frame to restore the dozens of FMV scenes, and integrate them back into the game.<br><br><strong>Upscaled FMVs<\/strong> - As an optional enhancement, the FMVs have been further elevated to sharper quality using the latest in video upscaling technology for the best Road Rash cinematics ever seen.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2448570\/extras\/8850502e456609835d451dbf8c7afd07.poster.avif?t=1793986604\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2448570\/extras\/8850502e456609835d451dbf8c7afd07.webm?t=1793986604\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2448570\/extras\/8850502e456609835d451dbf8c7afd07.mp4?t=1793986604\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><strong>Gameplay Optimizations<\/strong> - Enhanced for modern systems, enjoy improved framerates up to 60 FPS, native controller support, windowed mode, cloud saves, and more<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2448570\/extras\/7d1cbd9fecd30af0c52d40dcda57fcff.poster.avif?t=1793986604\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2448570\/extras\/7d1cbd9fecd30af0c52d40dcda57fcff.webm?t=1793986604\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2448570\/extras\/7d1cbd9fecd30af0c52d40dcda57fcff.mp4?t=1793986604\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br>This 30th Anniversary Edition is the ultimate way to enjoy one of the most important franchises in gaming history.<br><br><br><strong>Original Road Rash game description:<\/strong><br><br>Road Rash, the most aggressive motorcycle racing game ever, explodes on your PC with hard-hitting, full-throttle action that'll bring you to your freshly skinned knees. Dodge traffic, outrace cops, and thrash opponents on your way to winning the Cup and becoming the menace to society your mother always worried about.<br><br>- Engage in lawless, no holds barred high speed motor cycle street racing through cities, canyons, and packs of vicious bikers!<br><br>- Photo-realistic 3D graphics with texture-mapping, atmospheric effects and super fast frame rate<br><br>- 25 knee-scraping races: 5 levels of racing, each with 5 courses, means only the toughest rashers have a chance to win the Cup","short_description":"Road Rash, the franchise which defined the combat racing genre, returns in the first ever digital version of the game. This 30th Anniversary Edition includes a fully relicensed soundtrack, higher resolution cinematics, up to 60 FPS gameplay, and more.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2448570\/a12ed683c51938590f28400c89cd8c8204e1e8db\/header.jpg?t=1793986604","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2448570\/ba16eeb1746726f003fe0a756a96875354b75664\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793986604","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2448570\/ba16eeb1746726f003fe0a756a96875354b75664\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793986604","website":"https:\/\/www.ea.com\/games\/library\/ea-classics","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 or Windows 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Any 1 GHz Intel or AMD processor (dual-core or better)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> DirectX 9 compatible graphics with 128 MB VRAM<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 9.0c<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 4 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Any Windows-compatible sound device<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 or Windows 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3 \/ AMD Ryzen 3 (or any modern 2.0 GHz+ CPU)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Any dedicated or modern integrated GPU with DirectX 9+ support<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 9.0c<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 4 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Any Windows-compatible sound device<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"legal_notice":"Internet connection; Steam Account; acceptance of EA User Agreement (terms.ea.com) required to play. EA’s Privacy & Cookie Policy applies to your use of EA's services. You consent to any personal data collected through your use of EA's services being transferred to the United States, as further explained in the Privacy & Cookie Policy. EA Account may be required for online features. You must link your EA and Steam Accounts to access online features; EA may share your Account ID &\/or individual game and play records with Steam to validate your purchase &\/or refund request. Access to software content is limited to one EA &\/or one Steam Account & is non-transferable after purchase. You may need to be 13+ or 16+ to register for an EA Account (age may vary, see o.ea.com\/ea\/child-access for details). Some content may require gameplay to unlock. Content updates may be downloaded automatically, require additional storage, and incur bandwidth usage fees. EA may provide certain free incremental content &\/or updates. EA may retire online features after 30 days notice posted on ea.com\/service-updates.<br \/>\r\n<br \/>\r\nEA User Agreement: terms.ea.com\/de for German residents and terms.ea.com for all other residents<br \/>\r\nEA Privacy & Cookie Policy: privacy.ea.com\/de for German residents and privacy.ea.com for all other residents<br \/>\r\n<br \/>\r\n(c) 1996, 2026 Electronic Arts Inc.","developers":["Electronic Arts"],"publishers":["Electronic Arts"],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":999,"final":499,"discount_percent":50,"initial_formatted":"$9.99","final_formatted":"$4.99"},"packages":[1475540],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Road Rash™: 30th Anniversary Edition","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1475540,"percent_savings_text":"-50% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Road Rash™: 30th Anniversary Edition - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$9.99<\/span> $4.99","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":499}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":1,"description":"Multi-player"},{"id":49,"description":"PvP"},{"id":47,"description":"LAN PvP"},{"id":55,"description":"DualShock Controller Support"},{"id":57,"description":"DualSense Controller Support"},{"id":18,"description":"Partial Controller Support"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"1","description":"Action"},{"id":"9","description":"Racing"}],"screenshots":[{"id":